{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Develop your kingdom!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, you'll receive a set of new cards. Plan building placements carefully on the map. A wide variety of combinations unlock new possibilities for your hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541000/extras/11228820b9c5c375f7caa41941ccbf08.poster.webp?t=1757063576\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541000/extras/11228820b9c5c375f7caa41941ccbf08.webp?t=1757063576\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell unwanted items and purchase powerful cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541000/extras/f1c79a2b1c51e5cf6281e5a6211753ea.poster.webp?t=1757063576\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541000/extras/f1c79a2b1c51e5cf6281e5a6211753ea.webp?t=1757063576\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a powerful army and command your units!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom will provide the warriors \u2014 your task is to manage them wisely in turn-based battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541000/extras/636592e0b20890436236c604b8c00105.poster.webp?t=1757063576\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541000/extras/636592e0b20890436236c604b8c00105.webp?t=1757063576\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=337 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In fights against the forces of evil, you\u2019ll need to position your units strategically to minimize losses and boost combat efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541000/extras/c715d090d9d1edcb6fc76797a140c034.poster.webp?t=1757063576\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541000/extras/c715d090d9d1edcb6fc76797a140c034.webp?t=1757063576\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This won\u2019t be an easy journey \u2014 but that will make victory all the sweeter!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3541000?t=1757063576","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541000/a8c00142e3777c178a0579aaae917e164993ffe8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757063576","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541000/eb7a5fde256796825a67eb866a17bef00decba24/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757063576","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541000/eb7a5fde256796825a67eb866a17bef00decba24/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757063576","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Develop your kingdom!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, you'll receive a set of new cards. Plan building placements carefully on the map. A wide variety of combinations unlock new possibilities for your hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541000/extras/11228820b9c5c375f7caa41941ccbf